## with removes only the handled effect
V3001 7:4 function `f` performs `Clock`, which its signature does not allow (allowed: `{}`)
  Cause 7:42 `Clock.now()` `Clock.now` performs `Clock` here
  expected: {}
  actual: {Clock}
  fix (Suggested, InterfaceChange): Add `Clock` to the signature " ! {Clock}"
